# Numeric T5 round-trip: two-plane l1bmd load (1.0 low / 2.0 high), fvadd
# v+v, two-plane l1bmd collect. Verified on gpfn3: every PE's low plane
# becomes 2.0 (0x4000000040000000) and high plane 4.0
# (0x4080000040800000).

